ng[]{p[0], e[1], e[0] + re[0], re[0]};\n        }\n\n        public List<long[]> getEdges() {\n            int M = pos.size();\n            List<long[]> res = new ArrayList<>();\n            for (int i = 0; i < M; i++) {\n                res.add(getEdge(i));\n            }\n            return res;\n        }\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        \n        int N = sc.nextInt();\n        int M = 3;\n        int[] A = new int[M];\n        int[] B = new int[M];\n        for (int i = 0; i < M; i++) {\n            A[i] = sc.nextInt();\n        }\n        for (int i = 0; i < M; i++) {\n            B[i] = sc.nextInt();\n        }\n\n        int ans1 = 0;\n        for (int i = 0; i < M; i++) {\n            ans1 += Math.min(A[i], B[(i + 1) % M]);\n        }\n\n        Dinic dinic = new Dinic(2 * M + 2);\n        int s = 2 * M;\n        int t = 2 * M + 1;\n        for (int i = 0; i < M; i++) {\n            dinic.add_edge(s, i, N);\n            dinic.add_edge(M + i, t, B[i]);\n            dinic.add_edge(i, M + i, A[i]);\n            dinic.add_edge(i, M + (i - 1 + M) % M, A[i]);\n        }\n        int ans2 = N - (int) dinic.flow(s, t);\n\n        System.out.println(ans2 + \" \" + ans1);\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.00011991735664196312, -1.9073468138230965e-06, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -0.0007363230688497424, -4.732496745418757e-05, -0.348446249961853, -0.00039891392225399613, -3.4570634852570947e-06, -8.4638240878121e-06, -2.7418097943154862e-06, -0.2254462093114853, -0.00043883229955099523, -3.576278118089249e-07, -2.7417760065873154e-05, -0.02977830357849598, -7.152555099310121e-07, -0.024091826751828194, -0.25355300307273865, -0.0007116645574569702, -7.152555099310121e-07, -0.0015136463334783912, -8.344646857949556e-07, -0.13467243313789368, -0.005438295193016529, -0.0002441108226776123, -1.5139465176616795e-05, -2.7418097943154862e-06, -0.6931